's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"3322cf690afddeb9641797b7941dcc46","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"119fc13a0fadcf3dd2674d4412d38ba5","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"cd0948a54a1435e44e96bb8170518ddd","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"1830417823a742dd884a0ef75269591e","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"032c92a368fc529f5d8b41ea2aff5b98","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"1b72018b6d30b10fd72c43671f027636","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"6cb24d8e97c14e9d6fa6049baced95e6","originalFileName":"dbeb7826-c841-4f12-aebf-a579f7549b04-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"log","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"5bb3b500